# Everything in this directory is build output. Nothing here is committed.
#
# Produced either by `scripts/ci/build-wasm.sh` for local browsing, or by the
# `deploy-pages` job in main-ci.yml, which runs its own `wasm-pack build` into
# this path before publishing. The deployed site has therefore never loaded a
# committed bundle.
#
# It used to be committed anyway, and the cost was one-sided: 87 commits of a
# 4.6 MB binary came to ~223 MB, about 86% of the repository's history, while
# going stale often enough to twice report a fix as live that was not in the
# bundle being tested.
#
# To browse site/ locally, run scripts/ci/build-wasm.sh once (~9 min cold).
# scripts/ci/check-wasm-freshness.py answers whether what you built still
# matches your sources.
*
!.gitignore
